          "No explicit source/config/scope revision binding columns; use immutable core scopeRef + queryable binding with increment migration if required",
          "due_minor definition must be core checkout-scope customer due, not inferred invoiceGross when consideration offsets exist",
          "expires_at must not erase already paid/UNKNOWN intent evidence"
